  "description": "Token-issuance primitives for Amazon Cognito-shaped JWTs: RS256 access-token and ID-token minting with Cognito claim conventions (token_use, client_id, cognito:groups, identities[]), plus a refresh-token store contract and in-memory implementation. Symmetric counterpart to Trax.Api.Auth.Jwt.Cognito's validator. NO WARRANTY. Trax .NET auth is plumbing, not a security product. You are solely responsible for securing systems that use it. See SECURITY-DISCLAIMER.md.",
